  - Speaker: Prince Julian
    Text: Perhaps, but it would be best to keep that to ourselves...
    WordsPerMinute: 0
    SpeakerSide: 2
    LeftName: Laurice
    RightName: Prince Julian
    LeftPortrait: {fileID: -3154334995067897491, guid: 08ed030703cd4f04ca27434672621d8b,
