    RightPortrait: {fileID: -2861679652154964632, guid: 0747003b8d5cd804da0e2241c6efb15e,
      type: 3}
  - Speaker: Prince Julian
    Text: A wary heart would only make others more wary and we have not the strength
      to match them yet...
